| 013  | Cache Bun dependencies in GitHub Actions | P3 | S | — | DONE |
| 007  | Remove the unused Bun/TypeScript scaffolding and write a real README | P3 | S | 001 | DONE |

Status values: TODO | IN PROGRESS | DONE | BLOCKED (with one-line reason) | REJECTED (with one-line rationale)

## Dependency notes

- 001 goes first because a clean checkout (which CI is) cannot build if `src/chinese-java/theme.json` is missing; its step 1 checks that.
- 003 before 002, 006, 008: it creates `dist/main.css`, the `check` script and `scripts/check-css.mjs` that the later plans extend.
- 006 extends the `check` script with `check-js`; 008 appends `check-build`. Do 003 → 006 → 008 or 003 → 008 → 006; each plan appends to whatever the `check` script already contains.
- 005 needs 006 because the QR dialog moves into a partial there.
- 007 needs 001 so the README can truthfully say CI builds and deploys.
- 009 and 010 touch the same three templates as 006 but different lines; they are order-independent.

## Findings considered and rejected

- `{{year}}` / `{{dateFull}}` inside story JSON text: works by design because fragments render before scalars.
- `parents` arrays joined with `<br>`: correct as written.
